[heading]Icon Attribution[/heading]
The Import glyph follows the visual language of [url=https://tabler.io/icons]Tabler Icons[/url], an MIT-licensed open-source icon set. The live controls are drawn from native UMG primitives rather than loading external icon textures at runtime.
